{"ID":"20240206090654-aed7a9x","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206090654-aed7a9x","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206090654-aed7a9x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206090705-wpuys74\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206090659-w9jtk8n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206090705-wpuys74\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:134,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:134\u0026#125;","title":"明党参（明沙参、山花根、土人参、山胡萝卜）","type":"doc","updated":"20240830172310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206090705-wpuys74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206090705-wpuys74","updated":"20240206090708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产浙江、江苏、安徽等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈细长圆柱形、长纺锤形或不规则条块，长620cm，直径0.52cm。表面黄白色或淡棕色，光滑或有纵沟纹及须根痕，有的具红棕色斑点。质硬而脆，断面角质样，木部黄白色，皮部较薄，有的易与木部剥离，木部类白色。气微，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘、微苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t润肺化痰，养阴和胃，平肝，解毒。用于肺热咳嗽，呕吐反胃，食少口干，目赤眩晕，疔毒疮疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240206090659-w9jtk8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206090659-w9jtk8n","updated":"20240206090659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206090659-7s14v2n.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714102612-gntq0ji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714102612-gntq0ji","updated":"20240714105433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 381px;","style":"width: 371px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参-20240714104030-2r1ff13.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 371px;\" parent-style=\"width: 381px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 404px;","style":"width: 394px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 9-20240714105433-11x222p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 394px;\" parent-style=\"width: 404px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 405px;","style":"width: 395px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 5-20240714104944-obqgm1x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 395px;\" parent-style=\"width: 405px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714105141-v14ejig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714105141-v14ejig","updated":"20240714105235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 530px;","style":"width: 520px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 6-20240714105141-mvrhu7x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 520px;\" parent-style=\"width: 530px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 531px;","style":"width: 521px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 7-20240714105235-g2a9tw2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 521px;\" parent-style=\"width: 531px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830172255-s1dluxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172255-s1dluxj","updated":"20240830172255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 428px;","style":"width: 418px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 12-20240714105856-cbjvgq2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 418px;\" parent-style=\"width: 428px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 567px;","style":"width: 557px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 13-20240714105956-6b92rwj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 557px;\" parent-style=\"width: 567px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830172255-6y0gcc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172255-6y0gcc4","updated":"20240830172255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 427px;","style":"width: 417px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 11-20240714105814-aonb6zt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 417px;\" parent-style=\"width: 427px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 835px;","style":"width: 825px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 10-20240714105620-pynoyyr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 825px;\" parent-style=\"width: 835px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714104203-vxk3zxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714104203-vxk3zxo","updated":"20240714105254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 627px;","style":"width: 617px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 1-20240714104203-s3t1ddp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 617px;\" parent-style=\"width: 627px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 575px;","style":"width: 565px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 4-20240714104907-n9g2rw5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 565px;\" parent-style=\"width: 575px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714104337-0ev5aaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714104337-0ev5aaq","updated":"20240714105029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 2-20240714104337-ixrysz0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 629px;","style":"width: 619px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"明党参 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/明党参 3-20240714104441-ijhmn1z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 619px;\" parent-style=\"width: 629px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714104441-rtltkkm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240714104441-rtltkkm"}},{"ID":"20240830172302-zzi0rkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-zzi0rkm","updated":"20240830172310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：明党参"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-hxg72eh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-hxg72eh","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"明党参《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-k5ayc09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-k5ayc09","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MínɡDǎnɡShēn"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-ld5o6a4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-ld5o6a4","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RADIXCHANGII"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-uli9xp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-uli9xp8","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】明沙参、粉沙参、山花"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-sbwicqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-sbwicqa","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为伞形科植物明党参ChangiumsmyrnioidesWolff的干燥根。4～5月采挖，除去须根，洗净，置沸水中煮至无白心，取出，刮去外皮，漂洗，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-al5ls1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-al5ls1g","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈细长圆柱形、长纺锤形或不规则条块，长6～20cm,直径0.5～2cm。表面黄白色或淡棕色，光滑或有纵沟纹及须根痕，有的具红棕色斑点。质硬而脆，断面角质样，皮部较薄，黄白色，有的易与木部剥离，木部类白色。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-iga3xxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-iga3xxn","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】取本品粉末1g，加稀乙醇20ml，超声处理20分钟，滤过，滤液蒸干，残渣加酸性稀乙醇（用稀盐酸调节PH值至2～3）1ml使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取明党参对照药材1g，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各5μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以正丁醇-冰醋酸-水（19：5：5）为展开剂，二次展开，第一次展至5cm，第二次展至10cm，取出，热风吹干，喷以茚三酮试液，加热至斑点显色清晰。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-04wndod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-04wndod","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】洗净，润透，切厚片，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-lfypsuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-lfypsuu","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、微苦，微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-olky2e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-olky2e8","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、脾、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-a1yvxrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-a1yvxrm","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】润肺化痰，养阴和胃，平肝，解毒。用于肺热咳嗽，呕吐反胃，食少口干，目赤眩晕，疔毒疮疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-x7i2lgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-x7i2lgu","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】6～12g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-m0p9yt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-m0p9yt3","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防潮，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-f3ftvt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-f3ftvt6","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-08zfs2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-08zfs2t","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"明党参《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-ls54z5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-ls54z5v","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《饮片新参》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-ekhrp64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-ekhrp64","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MínɡDǎnɡShēn"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-blr58ef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-blr58ef","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】土人参、百丈光、天瓠（《证治准绳》），粉沙参，红党参（《本草从新》），金鸡爪（《本草求原》），山花（《中国药植志》），山萝卜（《浙江中药手册》），明沙参（《中药志》），明参（《四川中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-er7byqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-er7byqz","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为伞形科植物明党参的根。春季采挖，除去茎叶及须根，洗净泥土，置沸水中煮至无白心，取出，刮去外皮，晒干。商品称\"明党参\"。在江苏、浙江地区，拣取粗壮者，不经煮沸，直接晒至半干，刮去外皮，再晒干。商品称\"粉沙参。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-fbwdxyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-fbwdxyw","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，高50～100厘米。根粗壮，圆柱形或粗短纺锤形。茎直立，中空，上部分枝。根生叶具长柄，柄长约30厘米，基部扩大呈鞘状抱茎；叶片全角为广卵形，长6～15厘米，呈三出式的二至三回羽状分裂，小裂片披针形。花茎常由一侧抽出，直立，与叶丛相距较远，表面有细纵纹，上部疏展分枝；花序顶生，成疏阔圆锥状复伞形花序，无总苞，伞梗5～10枚，长2～10厘米，细柔；小总苞片数枚，锥形，比小伞梗短；小伞梗10～15枚，纤细，长5～8毫米；花小，直径约2毫米；花萼具5细齿，极不显着；花瓣5，卵状披针形，白色；雄蕊5，花药椭圆形，花丝细长；子房下位，椭圆形，花柱2，开展；侧枝花序雌蕊常不育。双悬果广椭圆形，长3～4毫米，宽2.5～3毫米，光滑而有纵纹，果棱不明显，果棱间有油管3个，合生面有油管2个。花期4～5月。果期5～6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-wvgrkjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-wvgrkjc","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山野稀疏灌木林下土壤肥厚的地方。分布江苏、浙江、安徽等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-fzcfzld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-fzcfzld","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-ag8e3rk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-ag8e3rk","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①明党参"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-j5k38lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-j5k38lg","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥的根，呈纺锤形咸长纺捶形。长至15厘米，直径1.5厘米。外表面淡黄白色，具蜡样光泽，有明显支根痕。质坚硬而脆，易折断，断面不整齐，黄白色，半透明，粉质。形成层与木质部极易分离。气微香，味甘甜。以粗壮均匀、质坚实而重，皮细、断面黄色而半透明者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-n7a3f6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-n7a3f6s","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产江苏、安徽、浙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-fwbuoss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-fwbuoss","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②粉沙参"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-ksv3xee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-ksv3xee","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥的根，大小与明党参相似，唯外表面淡黄色，不现蜡光。质硬，断面类白色，粉状，棕色形成层极明显。气微香。以身干、色白者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-0g5lut9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-0g5lut9","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产浙江、江苏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-89h4r02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-89h4r02","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含少量挥发油、多量淀粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-rdm1kbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-rdm1kbc","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】用清水稍浸后捞出，润透切片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-1v7t3lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-1v7t3lt","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-arta1tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-arta1tr","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘微苦，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-rr3mpqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-rr3mpqa","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草从新》：\"甘，微寒，味淡。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-f8fqmw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-f8fqmw4","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求原》：\"甘，平，微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-bzc0lhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-bzc0lhp","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《饮片新参》：\"苦，微甘。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-rswk8ti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-rswk8ti","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】《四川中药志》：\"入肝、肺二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-8agryl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-8agryl5","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-cqot5cz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-cqot5cz","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清肺，化痰，平肝，和胃，解毒。治痰火咳嗽喘逆，头晕，呕吐，目亦，白带，疔毒疮疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-cfagaad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-cfagaad","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草从新》：\"补肺气，通、下行，补气生津。治咳嗽喘逆，痰壅火升，久疟，淋沥，难产，经闭，泻痢由于肺热，反胃噎膈由于燥涩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-6plz81g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-6plz81g","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求原》：\"养血生津，消热解毒。姜汁炒则补气、生肌、托散疮疡。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-yr6pon7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-yr6pon7","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《饮片新参》：\"温脾，化痰湿，平肝风。治头晕泛恶，中风昏仆。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-sdku627","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-sdku627","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《中药志》：\"润肺化痰止咳，和胃止呕。治咳嗽，呕吐；又能解毒治疔疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-jjzyns7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-jjzyns7","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《四川中药志》：\"祛风，解热，补肺镇咳。治肺虚咳嗽有痰，头昏目眩，风热目赤及口干。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-9o2r3sk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-9o2r3sk","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，2～4钱；或熬膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-bai776e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-bai776e","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-ph4u06v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-ph4u06v","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气虚下陷、精关不固及孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-lxfe68r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-lxfe68r","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草从新》：\"脾虚下陷、滑精梦遗俱禁用，以其下行而滑窍也。孕妇亦忌。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-rveuy5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-rveuy5p","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《饮片新参》：\"阴虚肝旺，内热烦渴者忌用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-6awe3u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-6awe3u0","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《四川中药志》：\"外感咳嗽无汗者忌用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-lnrce7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-lnrce7o","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药材学》：\"大量服食易引起浮肿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-w6ikh11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-w6ikh11","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防潮，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-olxx164","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-olxx164","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-dxv6d4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-dxv6d4y","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①补阴虚：土人参、对配茯苓。熬膏。（王安卿《采药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-mt5xz7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-mt5xz7o","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治白带初起：土人参（切片）三两，用陈绍酒饭上蒸熟，分作三服。（《百草镜》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-crtmblp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-crtmblp","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治杨梅结毒：土人参，酒煎服。（王安卿《采药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-98dfwnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-98dfwnk","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】《本草从新》：\"土人参，性善下降，能伸肺经治节，使清肃下行。凡有升无降之证，每见奇效。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-yzmnmz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-yzmnmz3","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-7jwtv2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-7jwtv2w","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"明党参《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-8t2w3gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-8t2w3gf","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-un8r9zd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-un8r9zd","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《饮片新参》。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-txg5nl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-txg5nl2","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草从新》：土人参，出江、浙，俗名粉沙参。红党参即将此参去皮净，煮极熟，阴干而成者，味淡无用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-jkq2wo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-jkq2wo9","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MínɡDǎnɡShēn"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-rzh6oke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-rzh6oke","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】MedicinalChangiumRoot,RootofMedicinalChangium"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-w4uddxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-w4uddxv","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】土人参、百丈光、天瓠、粉沙参、红党参、金鸡爪、山萝卜、明沙参"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-7yb9szc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-7yb9szc","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-ogsnoma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-ogsnoma","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为伞形科植物明党参的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-zs482o7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-zs482o7","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：ChangiumsmyrnioidesWolff"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-8pfpc96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-8pfpc96","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：移栽后的第3年5月中、下旬收获，晴天割去地上部分，将根挖出，洗净泥土，按大、小分级，而后分别放入沸水中煮10-15min，煮至内无白心，捞出放清水中漂洗数次，刮去外皮，晒干。如不经汤煮，直接刮去外皮晒干入药者，商品名“粉沙参”。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-e18c6ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-e18c6ym","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，高50-100cm。全株被白霜，无毛。根有两种形状；一种是圆柱形，细长，另一种是纺锤形或椭圆形，表面均呈淡黄色或黄褐色，断面白色。茎直立，圆柱形，表面具细纵条纹，中空，上部分枝，灰绿色。基生叶有长柄，柄长3-15cm；叶片三出或二至三回羽状全裂，一回羽片广卵形，长4-10cm，柄长2-5cm，二回羽片卵形或长圆状卵形，长2-4cm，柄长1-2cm，三回羽片卵形或卵圆形，长1-2cm，基部截形或近楔形，边缘3裂或羽状缺刻，末回裂片长圆状披针形，长2-4mm，宽1-2mm；茎上部叶呈鳞片状或鞘状。复伞形花序顶生或侧生，总苞片0-3；伞辐4-10，长2.5-10cm；小总苞片数个；小伞花序有花8-20，花蕾时略呈淡紫红色，开放后呈白色；萼齿小；花瓣长圆形或卵状披针形，长1.2-2mm，宽1-1.2mm，先端渐尖而内折；雄蕊5，花丝长约3mm，花药卵圆形至卵状长圆形，长3-4mm，宽2.5-3mm，分生果两端稍窄，背部向外隆起，表面有8-12条具节的棱，主棱隆起不明显。分生果横剖面呈椭圆形或不显着的五边形，每棱槽内分布油管3-5，合生而4-6，胚乳腹面深凹，呈马蹄形。花期4-5月，果期5-6，果期5-6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-2peb8m8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-2peb8m8","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-5qjn2fg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-5qjn2fg","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山地稀疏藻林下土壤肥厚处或山坡岩石缝隙中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-zsavh4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-zsavh4u","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于江苏、浙江、安徽、江西及湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-yz4pqjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-yz4pqjq","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-hrk25qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-hrk25qq","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜温湿润气候，耐荫、耐寒、怕强光直射，喜疏光。怕涝。宜选土层深厚，排水良好，疏松肥沃的砂质壤土或腐殖质土栽培。种子有胚后熟特性，种胚分化发育要求温度在5-10℃经30-40d完成胚后熟，种子才能萌发。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-mw3ncpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-mw3ncpu","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用种子繁殖。从4-5年生留种田的植株上于6-7月上旬，果实呈褐色时，分批采集种子，湿沙贮藏。将已处理备播的种子当年10月至翌年2月进行播种。条播，行距约30cm，沟深约5cm左右，播后盖土层以不见种子为度。苗床可采用撒播或条播。直播繁1hm2需种子22.5-30kg左右，条播为37.5-75kg，撒播75-105kg。种苗按各地物候情况不同，可掌握在须根萌动期前移栽为宜。一般于9月下旬至10月上旬移栽，按行株距20cm×10cm开穴栽种，移栽苗以当年生为好，苗大移栽易断根，要当日挖苗当日移栽，按行株距将参苗斜放沟中，芽头向上，根不弯曲，芽头以上盖土6cm左右。定苗可于第2年出苗后进行，除去病、弱、小和过密株，留足苗数，及时查苗补缺。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-cnkh2aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-cnkh2aa","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理播种后要保持土壤温度，以提高出苗率。出苗后及时拔除杂草。4月中旬，结合除草、松土，施入少量稀粪水。苗期注意防旱和排水，可适当在畦面或行间种植高秆植物遮荫，或与农作物间作，定植或移栽出苗后，每次结合除草、松土适当追施人畜粪水，冬季清沟保墒，追施腊肥。移栽2-3年为生长速度最快时期，。施肥次数和数量均需增多，并配合施用磷、钾肥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-gb4ihv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-gb4ihv8","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治病害有裂根病、灼热病、猝倒病；虫害有胡萝卜微管蚜、黄凤蝶。防治方法参见“白芷”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-eerj0n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-eerj0n6","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-phr7b07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-phr7b07","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别：明党参：干燥的根，呈纺捶形或长纺锤形。长至15cm，直径1.5cm。外表面淡黄白色，具蜡样光泽，有明显支根痕。质坚硬而脆，易折断，断面不整齐，黄白色，半透明，粉质。形成层与木质部极易分离。气微香，味甘甜。以粗壮均匀、质坚实而重、皮细、断面黄色而半透明者为佳。主产四川、安徽、江苏、浙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-8zp9j8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-8zp9j8n","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉沙参：干燥的根，大小与明党参相似，唯外表面淡黄色，不现蜡光。质硬，断面类白色，粉状，棕色形成层极明显。气微香。以身干、色白者为佳。主产浙江、江苏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-2ej4lzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-2ej4lzy","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴定：根横切面：木栓导为多列木栓细胞。皮层为6-8列切向延长的细胞；有少数分泌道。韧皮部较宽，筛管群呈放射状排列，近形成层处较显着；分泌道多数，由5-7个分泌细胞围绕而成，切向50-95μm，径向40-60μm，内含黄棕色物；韧皮射线宽3列细胞。形成层连成环。木质部导管常单个散在或2-4个成君，放射状排列，直径24-80μm；木射线宽3列细胞；初生木质部二原型。本品薄壁细胞含演粉粒。粉末：黄白色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-kl0ttau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-kl0ttau","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淀粉粒多数，单粒圆球形，脐点裂缝状，层纹不明显；复粒由2-6个分粒组成。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-c3y6k93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-c3y6k93","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网纹导管多见。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-9g2l281","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-9g2l281","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分泌道碎片棕色，分泌细胞长方形，纵向排列，微带黄棕色分泌物。此外，可见糊化淀粉块、木栓细胞及棕色块状物。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-bhnj3l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-bhnj3l9","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"商品按加工方法不同，分明党参和粉沙参两种。明党参按其质量分四等；一等（银牙）长条形，长7.5-15cm，直径通常不超过1cm，色明亮，淡黄色，质坚实，多销香港；二等：（匀条）条较粗大，长不足15cm，直径一般1-1.5cm，淡黄色或黄棕色，质坚实；三等（粗枝）条粗，完整无碎，直径一般2cm左右，色略深，中心较疏松：四等（大头）粗条，大头空心破嬖枝，有的充满棕色块状物。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-0nqidyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-0nqidyh","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】根含挥发油0.08%，其中主成分为6，9-十八碳二炔酸甲酯（methyl-6,9-octadecadiynoate)，占总油量的52.48%，还含β蒎烯（β-pinene)，橙花叔醇（nerolidol)，丙酸橙花醇酯（nerylpropionate)，已酸十二醇酯（dodecylacetate），已酸十四醇酯（1-tetradecanolacetate)，1，7，7-三甲基二环[2。2。1]-2-庚烯[1，7，7-trimethyl-bicycol[2.2.1]hipt-2-ene]，1，2，4a，5，6，8a-六氢-4，7-二甲基-1-异丙基萘[1，2，4a，5，6，8a-hexahydro-4，7-dimethyl-1-(1-methylethyl)naphthalene]，十氢-1，6-双（亚甲基）-4-异丙基萘[decahydro-1，6-bis-(methylene)-4-(1-methylethyl)naphthalene]，2，3，4，5，6，7-六氢-1六氢-1h-2--茚醇（2,3,4,5,6,-hex-ahyldro-1H-inden-2-ol)等[1]。又含游离脂肪油0.68%和结合脂肪油0.67%；主要的游离脂肪酸为9，11-十八碳二烯酸（9，11-octadecadienicacid)，还有6-苯基壬酸（6-phenylnonanoicacid)，棕榈酸（palmiticacid)等；主要的结合脂肪酸为2-羟基-1-甲基-9，12-十八烯酸（2-hydroxy-1-hydroxymethyl-9,10-octadeca-dienoicacid)，还有2-甲基十六酸（2-methylexadecanoicacid)，十六碳烯酸（hexadecenoicacid)，5-苯并环辛醇（5-benzocy-clooctenol)，硬脂酸（stearicacid)，亚油酸（linoleicacid)，棕榈酸等[2]。还含磷脂，其中有磷脂酸（phosphatidicacid)，磷脂酰胆碱（phosphatidylcholine)；磷脂中结合的脂肪酸为棕榈酸，9，11-十八碳二烯酸（9,11-octadecadienoicacid)，10-十八碳烯酸（10-oc-tadecenoicacid),15-甲基十六酸（15-methylhexadecanoicacid)，辛酸（octanoicacid)等[3]。另含明党参多糖（changiumsmyrnioidespolysaccharide)CSP，相对分子质量52000，系由鼠李糖（rham-nose)，阿拉伯糖（arabinose)，木糖（xylose)，甙露糖（mannose)，半乳糖（galactose)和葡萄糖（glucose)，按摩尔比0.09:0.25:0.17:1.0:1.56:11.94组成[4]。还含较多量的γ-氨基丁酸（γ-aminobutyricacid)，高量的天冬氨酸（asparticacid)和精氨酸（arginine)，以苏氨酸（threonine)，赖氨酸（lysine)，蛋氨酸（me-thionine)，缬氨酸（alanine)，鸟氨酸（ornithine)，谷氨酸（glu-tamicacid)，丝氨酸（serine)等共20种氨基酸[5]；人体必需或有益的微量元素钙、钴、铜、铬、铁、锗、锂、镁、锰、钼、钠、镍、磷、硒、锌、钡等18种[6]。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-zlbkqcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-zlbkqcs","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-t85zb4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-t85zb4w","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.对免疫功能的影响：陆平成等报道，小鼠腹腔注射1：10的明党参煎剂0.5ml，24小时后，脾细胞NK活性明显增高。体外实验中，高浓度的明党参煎剂（l：10）显着抑制NK活性，较低浓度（1：160-1：640）时则促进NK活性。进一步实验表明，明党参对小鼠NK活性的促进作用部份依赖于粘附细胞的存在。陈建伟等报道，小鼠口服明党参煎液15g/kg、明党参多糖30mg／kg重复给药4次，第1次间隔12小时，其后每8小时l次，36小时后收集小鼠腹腔巨噬细胞，作巨噬细胞C3b受体检测。结果表明，明党参煎液及多糖均能显着提高正常小鼠腹腔巨噬细胞YC-花环形成率，对照组为42.414±3.08，明党参煎液组为55.573±3.428（P＜0.001），明党参多糖组为51.039±2.724（P＜0.001）。说明明党参具有促进小鼠NK活性，激活巨噬细胞Cb受体，增强机体防癌抗感染的能力。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-1bu2dy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-1bu2dy8","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗脂质过氧化物作用：吴慧平等报道，明党参的乙酸乙酯、丙酮、甲醇提取物对体外大鼠肝匀浆上清液中过氧化脂质生成具有明显的抑制作用，其中以甲醇提取物作用最强。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-7kfkb2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-7kfkb2d","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】用清水稍浸后捞出，润透切片，晒干。在江苏、浙江地区，拣取粗壮者，不经煮沸，直接晒至半干，刮去外皮，再晒干。商品称粉沙参。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-c1kdfp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-c1kdfp5","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味甘；微苦；性微寒"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-gme2dlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-gme2dlp","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺；胃；肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-x5np5fa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-x5np5fa","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】润肺化痰；养阴和胃；解毒。主肺热咳嗽；呕吐反胃；食少口干；贫血；眩晕；妇女白带；疔毒疮疡"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-tkhq4r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-tkhq4r0","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，6-12g；或熬膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-clwu0zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-clwu0zp","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-muko7te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-muko7te","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.气虚下陷、精关不固及孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-yoodaj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-yoodaj4","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草从新》：脾虚下陷、滑精梦遗俱禁用，以其下行而滑窍也。孕妇亦忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-xvptw3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-xvptw3s","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《饮片新参》：阴虚肝旺，内热烦渴者忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-3fjdurj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-3fjdurj","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《四川中药志》：外感咳嗽无汗者忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-9dkpx6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-9dkpx6w","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药材学》：大量服食易引起浮肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-4kr2su7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-4kr2su7","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-g50z7wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-g50z7wc","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草从新》：土人参，性善下降，能使肺经治节，使清肃下行。凡有升无降之证，每见奇效。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-sej9y16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-sej9y16","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草从新》：补肺气，通、下行，补气生津。治咳嗽喘逆、痰壅火升，久疟，淋沥，难产，经闭，泻痢由于肺热，反胃噎膈由于燥涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-evql2g3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-evql2g3","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草求原》：养血生津，消热解毒。姜汁炒则补气、生肌、托散疮疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-6sr8t7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-6sr8t7r","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《饮片新参》：温脾，化痰湿，平肝风。治头晕泛恶，中风昏仆。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-xu858t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-xu858t8","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《中药志》：润肺化痰止咳，和胃止呕。治咳嗽，呕吐；又能解毒治疔疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-v93eyws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-v93eyws","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《四川中药志》：祛风，解热，补肺镇咳。治肺虚咳嗽有痰，头昏目眩，风热目赤及口干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172302-kizmojb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172302-kizmojb","updated":"20240830172333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240714104440-ly5yq1f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240714104440-ly5yq1f","updated":"20240830172333"}},{"ID":"20240830172304-u684kcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172304-u684kcl","updated":"20240830172333"}}]}